1028	## 8. Environment variables
1029	
1030	`.env.example` is committed. `.env.local` (dev) and `.env.production` (server, `chmod 600`) are never committed. **Only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` variables reach the client** ([Auth0 blog](https://auth0.com/blog/handling-auth-nextjs16-with-server-actions-middleware/)), and no secret may use that prefix. `src/lib/env.ts` validates all server variables with Zod at boot and fails fast.
1031	
1032	| Variable | Scope | Required | Example / default | Purpose |
1033	|---|---|---|---|---|
1034	| `AUTH0_DOMAIN` | server | yes | `dev-xxxx.us.auth0.com` | Auth0 tenant ([README](https://github.com/auth0/nextjs-auth0)) |
1035	| `AUTH0_CLIENT_ID` | server | yes | | |
1036	| `AUTH0_CLIENT_SECRET` | server | yes | | |
1037	| `AUTH0_SECRET` | server | yes | `openssl rand -hex 32` **[VERIFY convention]** | Session encryption |
1038	| `APP_BASE_URL` | server | prod yes | `https://mise.tech` | Optional in dev, where the SDK infers it from the host |
1039	| `DATABASE_URL` | server | yes | from `tiger db connection-string` | Typically `REDACTED` **[VERIFY format]** |
1040	| `DB_POOL_MAX` | server | no | `5` | postgres.js `max` |
1041	| `DATABASE_URL_TEST` | server (tests) | no | connection string of a `tiger service fork` | `npm run test:db` only; never production |
1042	| `GEMINI_API_KEY` | server | yes | | Gemini API |
1043	| `GEMINI_MODEL` | server | no | `gemini-3.8-flash` | Vision, adaptation, normalization |
1044	| `GEMINI_SEARCH_MODEL` | server | no | `gemini-3.8-flash` | Grounded discovery. Try `gemini-3.5-flash-lite` for latency **[VERIFY grounding support]** |
1045	| `DATAANDAPIS_KEY` | server | yes | | `X-Api-Key` for barcode lookup |
1046	| `OFF_BASE_URL` | server | no | `https://world.openfoodfacts.org` | Use `https://world.openfoodfacts.net` (basic auth `off:off`) while testing |
1047	| `OFF_USER_AGENT` | server | yes | `Mise/0.1 (team@example.com)` | Required custom UA ([OFF API](https://openfoodfacts.github.io/openfoodfacts-server/api/)) |
1048	| `RECIPE_FETCH_USER_AGENT` | server | yes | `MiseRecipeFetcher/0.1 (+https://mise.tech/bot)` | Honest UA for publisher fetches |
1049	| `ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` | server | no* | | *If missing, `/api/tts` returns 503 and the client uses `speechSynthesis` |
1050	| `ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID` | server | no | `JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb` (docs example voice) | ([Stream speech](https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/text-to-speech/stream)) |
1051	| `ELEVENLABS_MODEL_ID` | server | no | `eleven_flash_v2_5` | |
1052	| `DEFAULT_TZ` | server | no | `America/Vancouver` | |
1053	| `NEXT_PUBLIC_GESTURE_DEBUG` | client | no | `false` | Landmark overlay and FPS counter |
